{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build a haunted-house exploration game around darkness, shifting rooms, and a stolen urn, with a fixed overhead camera and controller-first play. I’ll also check the local game-toolchain instructions and the supplied AI Hub integration, then package the finished demo as one HTML file.\n"}}
