{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The first integrated test caught a frame-loop error before gameplay could render; I’ve isolated it and am fixing it now. The separate audio, menu, and networking checks are passing. Next I’m testing the full three-floor route, including locked doors, tool swapping, ghost encounters, and the final escape.\n"}}
